  "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock": "钥匙圈 / KWallet 自动解锁",
  "Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on your desktop.": "启用面部验证以在登录时自动解锁您的登录密钥环或KWallet。这会将您的密码安全地存储在 TPM 中（如果可用），或者使用仅限 root 的主密钥通过 AES-256-GCM 进行加密。根据您的桌面，将面部验证设置为 pam_gnome_keyring 或 pam_kwallet5 PAM_AUTHTOK。",
