  "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello": "欢迎来到⟦呃⟧",
  "Setup is done!": "设置完成！",
  "We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n\nYou can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. ": "我们完成了！ Ubuntu Hello 现在在此计算机上处​​于活动状态。尝试执行通常需要输入密码才能进行身份验证的任何操作，例如使用 sudo 运行命令。如果您启用了密钥环自动解锁，您的登录密钥环或KWallet也将在登录时自动解锁。\n\n您可以稍后打开 Ubuntu Hello 配置器来更改更多高级设置或添加其他模型。按下面的“完成”关闭此窗口并打开 Ubuntu Hello 配置器。",
  "Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in.": "Ubuntu Hello可以使用人脸验证自动解锁您的登录钥匙圈或KWallet，避免登录后出现密码提示。",
  "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking": "启用自动钥匙圈/KWallet解锁",
  "Confirm password": "确认密码",
  "Setting a certainty policy": "制定确定性政策",
  "Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set how strict Ubuntu Hello should be.": "由于角度、距离和其他因素的变化，面部匹配永远不会与存储的面部模型完全相同。在此页面上，您可以设置Ubuntu Hello的严格程度。",
  "Fast": "快速地",
  "Allows more fuzzy matches, \nbut speeds up the scanning process greatly.": "允许更多的模糊匹配， \n但大大加快了扫描过程。",
  "Balanced": "均衡",
  "Still relatively quick detection, \nbut might not log you in when further away.": "还是比较快的检测， \n但距离较远时可能无法登录。",
  "Secure": "安全的",
  "The slightly safer option, \nbut will take much longer to authenticate you": "稍微安全一点的选择， \n但需要更长的时间来验证您的身份",
  "Adding a face model": "添加面部模型",
  "To authenticate you Ubuntu Hello needs to save a model of your face to recognise you. Press the Scan button below to start the facial scan.": "为了验证您的身份，Ubuntu Hello需要保存您的脸部模型来识别您。按下面的扫描按钮开始面部扫描。",
  "Configuring webcam": "配置网络摄像头",
  "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?": "红外线发射器是否闪烁？",
  "yes": "是的",
  "no": "不",
  "Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next.": "Ubuntu Hello 将自动搜索您的系统以查找任何可用的摄像头，因此请确保您的网络摄像头已连接。检测后，将显示可用网络摄像头的列表。选择您要使用的，然后单击“下一步”。",
